{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOW LOADING...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long are you willing to wait for loading?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOW LOADING SIMULATOR is a game where you keep waiting until the loading reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have nothing else to do, just start up this game and wait until it reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you have to do is wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once it reaches 100%, you will surely feel a great sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is there anything else you need to do besides gaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If that happens, quit the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The next time you resume the game, it will start from 0%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tell us how you felt when you reached 100%.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678580?t=1745108095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678580?t=1745108095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678580/c813691614c0c3edde8c762d6823ee4d6121a2ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745108095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678580/c813691614c0c3edde8c762d6823ee4d6121a2ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745108095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOW LOADING...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long are you willing to wait for loading?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOW LOADING SIMULATOR is a game where you keep waiting until the loading reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I